WEBVTT

00:33:27.885 --> 00:33:31.107
where we're able to look back
on our dark nights of the soul

00:33:31.131 --> 00:33:32.960
and see it in a grander context,

00:33:32.984 --> 00:33:36.238
and be able to see the way
that what I experienced with Rayya

00:33:36.262 --> 00:33:39.195
prepares me now
to sit in the room with people

00:33:39.219 --> 00:33:41.905
when they are in
their unbearable suffering,

00:33:41.929 --> 00:33:47.238
and to be in a state of compassionate
relaxation with them,

00:33:47.262 --> 00:33:48.510
to be able to know, like,

00:33:48.534 --> 00:33:53.706
"Oh boy, I know where you are.
And I'm so glad that I know where you are.

00:33:53.730 --> 00:33:56.370
And I don't know how
you're going to get off that floor,

00:33:56.394 --> 00:33:57.553
but you will.

00:33:57.577 --> 00:34:01.409
In the meantime, I'm just here holding
space for you while you're in agony."